[h1]Community Mod Framework[/h1]

The [b]Community Mod Framework (CMF)[/b] is a shared utility mod that provides a mod menu and modding tools for Europa Universalis V.

[b]CMF should be loaded first in your mod load order.[/b]

[h1]Documentation[/h1]
[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki]GitHub Wiki[/url] — Full documentation
[*][url=https://eu5.paradoxwikis.com/Community_Mod_Framework]EU5 Paradox Wiki[/url] — Quick reference
[*][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework]GitHub Repository[/url]
[/list]

Any questions, feel free to reach out via the Modding Co-op: https://discord.gg/aqAAcCZsY7

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Community Mod Menu (CMM):[/b] A shared in-game mod settings window. Mod authors register settings dynamically through a simple API — no need to build a custom settings UI.
  [list]
   [*]Toggle, button, numeric, slider (double click to drag), dropdown, text (singleplayer-only), and list settings
   [*]Per-mod tabs, groups, and search
   [*]Global settings with host-only multiplayer editing
   [*]CMM Visual Editor tool for code-free setup
  [/list]
[*][b]Custom Alerts:[/b] Create and show custom alerts in the alert bar through localization keys and scripted GUIs.
[*][b]Action Bar:[/b] Add custom action bar buttons with localization keys and scripted GUIs.
[*][b]cmf_suppress Effect:[/b] Suppress "used but never set" and "set but never used" engine warnings with a single effect call.
[*][b]Building Hiding:[/b] Hide building types from the Production -> Buildings view.
[*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-toolkit]Community Mod Toolkit (CMT):[/url][/b] A companion set of development tools, such as a mod template, workshop uploader, and mod translator.
[/list]

